Write the control.l file using LEX to tokenize control structure keywords. 
Write the control.y file using YACC to define grammar rules for C control structures. 
Compile and execute the program using: 
  o lex control.l 
  o yacc -d control.y 
  o gcc lex.yy.c y.tab.c -o control 
  o ./control
Input sample control structures in C-style syntax to check for validation. 
